# api (FastAPI) — {% .ProjectName%}

AI agent instructions for the FastAPI backend.

## Stack

- Python 3.11+, FastAPI, Pydantic v2, SQLAlchemy 2.0 (async)
- Alembic migrations, pytest + pytest-asyncio
- Ruff (lint/format) + Pyright (strict type checking)

## Rules

- Python is fully type-annotated; `pyright` strict mode must pass.
- Use the settings object from `app.core.config`; do not read `os.environ` directly.
- Routes live in `app/api`; models in `app/models`; business logic in `app/services`.
- All changes require tests (`uv run pytest`).

## Commands

```bash
uv sync            # install dependencies
uv run pytest      # run tests
uv run ruff check .  # lint
uv run ruff format . # format
uv run pyright     # type check (strict)
```
